<h2 id="current-prototype-boundary">10. Current Prototype Boundary</h2>
<p>A white paper about an active research system must separate implemented capability from accepted architecture. As of LUNA Core v0.5 in August 2026, the repository describes a working cognitive-kernel foundation alongside major systems that remain partial, shadow-only, or proposed. The status below is deliberately conservative.</p>
